{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.root_of_unity_truncation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.root_of_unity_truncation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.root_of_unity_truncation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.root_of_unity_truncation","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L60-L82","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe [QOU axiom](#def:substrate-parameter) requires that $q$ is\n**not** a root of unity.  But the limit $q \\to 1$ passes through\na dense set of roots of unity, and at each root the\nrepresentation theory undergoes a dramatic truncation that\n**strengthens** regularity.  The blowup at $q = 1$ is the\naccumulation of infinitely many such truncations.\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the claim over the context class and\n    discharges it from the class's `impl_*` fields (§3b-conditional;\n    fully proved). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.impl_blowup_iff_kappa","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.impl_blowup_iff_kappa","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L58-L58","doc":"(v) Blow-up iff bounded core aspect ratio ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.impl_bernstein_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.impl_bernstein_bound","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L56-L56","doc":"(iv) Bernstein bound at root of unity ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.impl_classical_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.impl_classical_limit","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L54-L54","doc":"(iii) Classical limit ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.impl_root_unity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.impl_root_unity","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L52-L52","doc":"(ii) Root-of-unity truncation level `κ ≥ 2` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.impl_generic_qou_regime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.impl_generic_qou_regime","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L50-L50","doc":"(i) Generic `q > 1` (QOU regime) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.truncation_active","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.truncation_active","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L48-L48","doc":"Hypothesis that root of unity truncation is active. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.root_unity_truncated","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.root_unity_truncated","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Proposition: root of unity truncation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.coreBounded","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.coreBounded","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Statement that the core aspect ratio stays bounded, `κ(t) = O(1)`.\nReplaces the withdrawn field `leviNonDeg` (\"the Levi form stays\nnon-degenerate at the collision point\"), 2026-11-15, owner decision\n(PR #7747, bean `qou-fm7s`): in dimension 3 the Levi datum is the\nsingle scalar `ξ·curl ξ` and branch (A) of `conj:levi-degeneracy` is\nrefuted by a Beltrami solution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.nsBlowsUp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.nsBlowsUp","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Statement that the Navier-Stokes system blows up at the\ncollision of two vortex filaments. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.C","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Universal Bernstein constant `C` for the trigonometric-polynomial\nbound `sup_t κ(t) ≤ 1 + C·(κ − 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.κ_t","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.κ_t","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Core aspect ratio at the root-of-unity truncation level `κ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.j_max","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.j_max","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Truncation-level upper bound `j_max(κ) = (κ − 2)/2` (number of\nsurviving spin states at level `κ`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.κ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.κ","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L26-L26","doc":"Truncation level `κ ∈ ℕ_{≥2}` indexing the root-of-unity tower. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.q","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L24-L24","doc":"The substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L22-L22","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.RootOfUnityTruncationContext","kind":"class","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/root_of_unity_truncation.lean#L18-L58","doc":"Abstract context for the `root_of_unity_truncation` claim — manuscript-named\ntyped fields below; the `holds` field carries the `Prop`-valued\nclaim of the lemma. ","signatureChunk":0}]}